WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.700
Narrator: This is the chain of communication.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.900
Narrator: With a radio, you call your supervisor first.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.600
Narrator: No radio - or no supervisor? Tell the nearest colleague, by signal or in person.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.800
Narrator: They pass it on - to the supervisor, the Area Leader, the venue manager and the VOC.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Narrator: Every link passes it on. Nobody goes silent.

